<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Autopage half yr shr surges, no div.</title>
<headline>Autopage half yr shr surges, no div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended August 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr, (cts)</p>
<p>    - attrib		  3.5	     vs 1.5</p>
<p>    - headline		3.6	     vs 1.2</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   1.28	    vs 0.54</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   3.12	    vs 1.21</p>
<p>    Tax			 1.36	    vs 0.66</p>
<p>    Interest		  0.91 received vs 0.28 paid</p>
<p>    Turnover		  133.75	  vs 95.52</p>
<p>Full name: Autopage Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Directors said they were optimistic about the future of South Africa's personal communications market in which Autopage is active.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
